<title>SINGAPORE: Indonesia cuts price of Minas to $22.60-traders.</title>
<headline>Indonesia cuts price of Minas to $22.60-traders.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price of Indonesia's main Minas crude oil for November lifting was calculated at $22.60 per barrel, down 52 cents from October's $23.12, traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>Prices of other grades were as follows:</p>
<p>    TYPE		   NOV	     OCT</p>
<p> Ardjuna		  22.73	   23.38</p>
<p> Arun Condensate	22.64	   23.22</p>
<p> Attaka		   23.58	   24.22</p>
<p> Cinta		    21.87	   22.40</p>
<p> Duri		     21.07	   21.54</p>
<p> Handil		   22.34	   22.90</p>
<p> Lalang		   22.54	   23.08</p>
<p> Widuri		   21.80	   22.33</p>
<p> Belida		   23.57	   24.25</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3081)</p>
